{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Success In Progress is a precision platformer game focused on improving, in which failure helps you get closer to the goal each time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each time you fail, you splash, creating tomato sauce that will help you go higher every time.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sauce splashing, the world reacts to you falling by splashing sauce everywhere</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wall jumping! If you end up with sauce on a wall or the side of a platform, you can jump off of it!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 full-length levels (And maybe a bit more somewhere hidden?)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One very handsome Tomato (Or it is really &quot;one&quot;?)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 special modifiers to re-play the levels in a completely different way</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand-Drawn graphics, for every single bit of a level</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic auto-save, leave and comeback at any time, your level progress will be saved</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you conquer every salad?</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Tomato Trainee","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3238190/3337cd44be2e8b247354d072a597f5e42f9c451c.jpg"},{"name":"Fast Paced","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3238190/f11642eaa4a4c38ce7e9b61c479ebbc5d1b64957.jpg"},{"name":"Fresh Soldier","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3238190/b5324bc3851aa6d9a960c00eafade9d6a8b6ee56.jpg"},{"name":"Tomato Commander","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3238190/30f6cfcc3e675abb1339ba4ba293b03c1779358e.jpg"},{"name":"Tactic Tom